{"version":1,"key":"card:730","content":{"id":730,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在页面关闭或跳转时上报数据是前端常见的需求，比如埋点统计、错误日志等。传统的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"XMLHttpRequest","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fetch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在页面卸载阶段往往来不及发出，或者会阻塞页面跳转，影响用户体验。为了解决这个问题，浏览器提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"navigator.sendBeacon(url, data)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个 API。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"url","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：数据发送的目标地址"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"data","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：可选，支持 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ArrayBuffer","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Blob","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"DOMString","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"FormData","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"URLSearchParams","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等类型"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调用后返回一个布尔值，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示浏览器已接受排队，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"false","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示提交失败。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sendBeacon","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用来向服务器发送少量数据（通常上限在 64KB 左右），它是异步的，不影响用户交互，不会阻塞页面卸载，也不会阻塞下一个页面的加载。即使页面正在关闭，浏览器也会保证把这个请求排队发出去。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sendBeacon","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 发出的始终是 POST 请求，并且是 fire-and-forget 模式，调用方无法获知服务端的处理结果。它的默认 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Content-Type","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"text/plain","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果需要发送 JSON，建议通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Blob","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包装来指定类型："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const blob = new Blob(\n  [JSON.stringify(data)],\n  { type: 'application/json' }\n);\nnavigator.sendBeacon('/api/report', blob);","uuid":"5cddac41-91c9-40c6-bfb2-e232403befe0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sendBeacon","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在页面卸载时仍能可靠发送的特性，它最典型的应用场景就是在用户离开页面时上报数据，比如页面停留时长、行为埋点或错误日志："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {\n  if (document.visibilityState === 'hidden') {\n    const payload = new Blob(\n      [JSON.stringify({ page: location.href, duration: performance.now() })],\n      { type: 'application/json' }\n    );\n    navigator.sendBeacon('/analytics', payload);\n  }\n});","uuid":"7fc0bf3b-5843-4100-8fec-4cb56806dd07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","title":"关于事件监听的选择","calloutType":"tip","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"监听 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"visibilitychange","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件比 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"beforeunload","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"unload","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 更可靠，因为后两者在移动端浏览器中经常不触发。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一个常见场景是错误日志上报，当页面发生未捕获的异常时，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sendBeacon","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将错误信息即时发送到服务端，即使用户随后关闭了页面也不会丢失："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"window.addEventListener('error', (e) => {\n  const payload = new Blob(\n    [JSON.stringify({\n      message: e.message,\n      source: e.filename,\n      line: e.lineno,\n      col: e.colno,\n      timestamp: Date.now()\n    })],\n    { type: 'application/json' }\n  );\n  navigator.sendBeacon('/log/error', payload);\n});","uuid":"66d0110b-a4f3-406f-80cc-25c89daeeb86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["浏览器/sendBeacon","JavaScript"],"createTime":1779181641934,"updateTime":1779184569639,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1779184569639}}